### 1a. Register coach A (o singură dată; la rerulare dă 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Antrenor",
  "email": "coach.a@example.com",
  "password": "parolaA12345"
}

### 1b. Register coach B (o singură dată)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Bogdan",
  "lastName": "Antrenor",
  "email": "coach.b@example.com",
  "password": "parolaB12345"
}

### 2a. Login A
# @name loginA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coach.a@example.com",
  "password": "parolaA12345"
}

### 2b. Login B
# @name loginB
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coach.b@example.com",
  "password": "parolaB12345"
}

### 3a. A își creează un elev → 201
# @name studentA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Elev3",
  "lastName": "DeA",
  "email": "elev.a3@example.com"
}

### 3b. B își creează un elev → 201
# @name studentB
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginB.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Elev3",
  "lastName": "DeB",
  "email": "elev.b3@example.com"
}

### 4. A cere elevul lui B → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/{{studentB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}

### 5. A listează → doar elevul lui (un singur element)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}

### 6. A modifică elevul lui B → 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/{{studentB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Furat",
  "lastName": "DeA"
}

### 7. A încarcă o partidă pentru elevul lui B → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentB.response.body.id}},
  "studentColor": "WHITE",
  "pgn": "[Result \"1-0\"]\n\n1. e4 e5 1-0"
}

### 8. A cere partidele elevului lui B → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games?studentId={{studentB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}

### 9. A cere statisticile elevului lui B → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats?studentId={{studentB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}

### 10. A încearcă reatribuirea (doar ADMIN) → 403
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/{{studentA.response.body.id}}/coach
Authorization: Bearer {{loginA.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coachId": {{loginB.response.body.coachId}}
}

### 11. B își șterge propriul elev → 204 (control pozitiv)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/{{studentB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginB.response.body.token}}

### 12. Fără token → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students